    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located on the Old Ashbourne Road ( The N2 ) just outside Ashbourne Town and 1 minute from the M2 junction at the Nine Mile Stone, giving easy access to Dublin City, Airport and M50.\r\n\r\nThe property is a 4 bedroom 1950’s cottage with a flat roof rear extension. It needs modernising and sits on c.1.15 acres of mature gardens with a detached garage and small sheds."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation : c.99 sq.m / c.1057 sq.ft\r\n\r\nSide Foyer : 3.25 X 2.26\r\n\r\nLounge : 4.91 X 3.51 Tiled floor, open fireplace \r\n\r\nKitchen : 4.68 x 3.52  A bright room with a wide range of floor & eye level \r\nunits, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nEntrance  Hall : 3.26 x 1.56 Laminate timber floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 : 4.91 x 3.26 \r\n\r\nBedroom 2; 2.45 x 3.18 \r\n \t\r\nBedroom 3 : 2.36 x 3.18\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 :4.68 x 3.18\r\n\t\r\nBathroom : 3.02 x 2.22 tiled floor and walls, wc, whb, shower unit."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "# Extended cottage from 1950.s with immense potential\r\n# c.1.15 acre site with mature hedging and on old water pump in situ..\r\n# c.10 minutes to Ashbourne, 2 mins to M2, \r\n# Oil Heating, Septic Tank, Mains Water."
      },
